  <iati-identifier>XM-DAC-7-PPR-240003515</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-7" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Netherlands</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">External final evaluation of the Orange Knowledge Program - period from 2018 to 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Orange Knowledge Program (OKP), which was implemented by Nuffic from 2018 to 2024, ended on 31 December 2024. In order to evaluate the relevance, coherence, effectiveness, efficiency, sustainability, gender equality and inclusivity of the program, and given its size of over EUR 310 million, it is necessary to carry out an independent external evaluation.
The program consisted of scholarships for Short Courses, Masters and tailor-made Trainings as well as grants strenghtening institutional cooperation projects in specific countries.
The evaluation aims to investigate effects of the OKP program (2018-2024) in targeted sectors and assess the extent to which the program has contributed to the objectives of sustainable and inclusive development in partner countries.</narrative>
  </description>
